{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "13be87a3dd314fde5b59c928941738ef6f138b4feee195fc98bf028afe92f0e2", "ja": "その舞台（ルビ：ステージ）にあるのは　無数の…\n“ひゃくまん”の　夢の扉", "zh": "那座舞台上有着无数……\n“百万”扇梦想之门", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
