{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "b56df8e4bead83871df385d09d9e6452084423fd6c5d1eb0d59df0209fc50d5e", "ja": "むふふ、どうぞどうぞ～♪", "zh": "唔呼呼，请进请进～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "e7fa38b9e28aa631a26c5e85a76d4eb134e004b3ed218a9681b7de482f6f7327", "ja": "それでは参りましょう♪", "zh": "那么，我们出发吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "e7e6522c35d83560f6a2244cf5f4a78ee51ba1d8dc625125e5017af8ed1cffb7", "ja": "ほら、こっちこっち！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "快，这边这边！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "962906cb9bb8f881a7ad44d62636bee649d9b78d222b72cd4f89614ade4b01e4", "ja": "あ、足元、気を付けてくださいね……？", "zh": "啊，请小心脚下……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "a0a8a8007b484b252de59d596e2bbdc0762ebbba2884d2c8b19040950810455a", "ja": "ウェルカムです～♪", "zh": "欢迎光临～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "d4bd80df41043c25dd01b8f6c73fd1f2a8b813e119559e9027a8882e9729c250", "ja": "◆ミリシタ用　アニメ「ミリオンライブ」\n連動コンテンツ用ロゴ表示", "zh": "◆剧场时光用 动画《百万现场》\n联动内容用Logo显示", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "43aa26c40620f650833f93388909f7d68f816b9084d4464f7aa3e51302a6d6f6", "ja": "『765プロライブシアタープロジェクト』\n準備中のある日……", "zh": "『765Pro Live Theater Project』\n筹备中的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "9e58f0419fa42fd109594162c51f04795291aadb21727de1519c356ad104add7", "ja": "おはようございます！\n今日も一日、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "早上好！\n今天也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "adeeb49b3aa690ccf3014173c25fde486376eaf57ad6509488ffd15298097198", "ja": "あっ、プロデューサーさん、ですよね？\nえへへ、おはようございます♪", "zh": "啊，您就是制作人先生吧？\n诶嘿嘿，早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "4519c7b727951bc10d891dc51b4d3f948c54a7551df1ba2266e8c8cb95e54a2c", "ja": "え？　……あの、うちの所属アイドルの方……では、\nないですよね？　……あ、その制服、もしかして！", "zh": "咦？……那个，您不是我们事务所的偶像……对吧？……啊，您穿的那身制服，难道是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "becba92d432186a47a1b3bef64c0a0805e9ff86baacbc2da6b5287f6b80209c8", "ja": "はっはっは、気が付いたようだね！\nその察しの良さ、さすがは私が見込んだ男だ！", "zh": "哈哈哈，看来你已经察觉到了！\n这份敏锐的洞察力，不愧是我看中的男人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "15e27b569153c4b9f1ce24b4facff6bf7eb74e90bb25e4edc25a22c226a831b5", "ja": "では紹介しますね！　この度、新しく765プロに\n入ってくれた、私の後輩の！　青羽美咲ちゃんです♪", "zh": "那么，我来介绍一下！这位是最近加入765事务所、我的后辈——青羽美咲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "6165a7d34325825c232ac332b41d83c606a9f670272f7a03474fbcb387ffa036", "ja": "はい♪　では改めまして。……765プロライブ劇場で\n事務などを担当することになりました、青羽美咲です。", "zh": "好的♪那么，再正式自我介绍一下。……我叫青羽美咲，今后将负责765制作人Live剧场的事务等工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "849d50d803cfa07db176419d5ae7909c4c8a62e8f58274b15f3ac154e92f1731", "ja": "まだ知らないことばかりで、たくさんご迷惑をおかけ\nしてしまうかもしれませんけど……", "zh": "我还什么都不太懂，可能会给您添很多\n麻烦就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "3b772573ef917c5f9452a993c7a4d3e8ec7b842ddc234b79918d8a07d165ab02", "ja": "でも！　一生懸命勉強して、精一杯、お手伝いさせて\nいただきますね。よろしくお願いいたします♪", "zh": "不过！我会努力学习，尽我所能帮忙的。还请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "658d09e05bb5239181929f07d4b8d5707d1c228fbd20b154f406e94ad53700d4", "ja": "青羽美咲さん……はい、こちらこそ！　新人同士、\n一緒に頑張りましょう。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "青羽美咲小姐……嗯，我也是！我们都是新人，一起加油吧。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "f85ee68ecc8c4c74efc6b8e89880bb26cdba3dd6d5e83ac25a34ecc90956cc4e", "ja": "うむ！　ライブシアタープロジェクトにとって、君達は\n二人とも、欠かすことのできない存在になるだろう。", "zh": "嗯！对Live Theater Project来说，你们两位都会成为不可或缺的存在吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "564be0b7d61a4e71bb1fdd609e79ee02a030d9a60d52f05eafa40208ed29b7ca", "ja": "若い者同士、しっかり力を合わせて進めてくれたまえ！\nよろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "年轻人之间就该齐心协力，好好把事情推进下去！\n拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1027_102mis", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "6e46c35f8b77dc2b05d8cf7bf7b032d9c383becbeb80207ee175c7e6d08ad32e", "ja": "ところで君、その新プロジェクトのことだが……。\nオーディションの方は順調かね？", "zh": "话说回来，关于你那个新项目……  \n试镜进行得还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "7df5b9a2c9df9661a631c2ece11cd3db0159fff90339df34588c757fba02eb09", "ja": "あ、はい。この間の先輩のライブのおかげで、\n応募も一層増えてます。", "zh": "啊，是的。多亏了前些天前辈的演出，\n报名的人也越来越多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "f5d927f32a7282bf864703a3c7ef7e04f32e1a8cebe4a7cbaf26267c04155cfd", "ja": "スカウトした子も、何人か好感触で。\nかなり集まってきてるかなと……！", "zh": "被挖掘的孩子里，也有几个人反响不错。感觉已经聚集了不少人了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "580599c4563eb098bfa4de8049b9bec43958f094ea9be9dd657ab3bc2bfb0e20", "ja": "結構結構！　となると、やはりここだけではもう\n手狭だろう。音無君、そろそろどうかな？", "zh": "很好很好！既然这样，看来这里只怕已经太狭窄了。音无小姐，差不多该换地方了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "d2852cf1cf419a51cc60758ce69ef572f01ae9a5d253ca2c4774def76c278fd6", "ja": "そうですね。まだステージ周りとか、\n場所によっては立ち入り禁止ですけど……。", "zh": "是啊。舞台周围之类的地方，根据场所不同还禁止入内……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "cdbea366dc87fe83940879aa87fd980e1543e4764b28fcdc91d9beeb56337e08", "ja": "！　まさか……！", "zh": "！难道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "25a9fd2b148918b5d4cf5b7c898fbdfad43ba107cb91df675bda10e183d1c361", "ja": "うむ！　新プロジェクトの活動拠点として、\n劇場のバックヤードを開放しよう！", "zh": "嗯！就开放剧场的后台，\n作为新企划的活动据点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1035_401pro", "source_sha256": "b1e775a5ac5a605c25a7db4853e910c25e3e72015f10fe35ae2f84848c93cced", "ja": "やった……！　あの、レッスンルームとかも、\nもうアイドルたちが使えるんですか？", "zh": "太好了……！那个，连练习室之类的地方，也已经可以让偶像们使用了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "3319e3f4fbe866c30bf6a6f934944f2f83f1f8d6fa3b6ad2dbd012800a822ca9", "ja": "もちろん、どんどん使ってくれたまえ！　アイドル達\nにも、早く劇場に慣れ親しんでほしいからね！", "zh": "当然，尽管用吧！我也希望偶像们\n能尽快熟悉并喜欢上剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "620bcf154d1bc76a0631bc6808e64d7ae64212ba2ff5845f161da6ad615b5f23", "ja": "君達二人も、これからは劇場に通い、アイドル達と\nともに過ごしながら、準備を進めてほしいのだよ。", "zh": "希望你们两位今后也能常来剧场，和偶像们\n一同度过的同时，推进各项准备工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "c070a09c39db91b652a6786baed4982918549971ab0fb1811a93bb564f5f8611", "ja": "チーフは当分、765プロオールスターズのツアーに\nかかりっきりですもんね。", "zh": "毕竟，Chief接下来一段时间都要忙于765Pro All Stars的巡演嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1039_101kot", "source_sha256": "9929ab85039ed4ee29522a5a96edc475fedf0985be7d6493bf5fbdfe3648c7fe", "ja": "プロデューサーさんには、しっかりお留守番して\nもらわないと。頼りにしてますよ♪", "zh": "制作人先生得好好留在这里看家才行。  \n就靠您啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1040_401pro", "source_sha256": "7fb4ad34c69a5893975a5e684b8ac6792f3e4b62e543a56ce9246fe1a71ffeca", "ja": "じゃあ、俺がアイドルたちと一緒に……。\nあの、まだそんなに自信はないですけど、頑張ります！", "zh": "那么，我就和偶像们一起……  \n那个，虽然我还没那么有自信，但我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1041_102mis", "source_sha256": "705e527a47c999d6c434dbf2eb1f059c0267f1fd1c734e0e118e37e870125b4d", "ja": "私も、少しでもお役に立てるよう頑張ります！　手先\nは器用な方だと思うので、何でも言ってくださいね♪", "zh": "我也会努力，争取哪怕能帮上一点忙！我觉得自己的手还挺巧的，有什么事尽管吩咐我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1042_president", "source_sha256": "28799989890709fd972d984c5f7df15d3fdac341372eda68252c18b9ae78cbe3", "ja": "うむ。アイドル諸君の自主性も尊重しながら、\n劇場をおおいに活用してくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯。在尊重各位偶像自主性的同时，\n请充分利用好剧场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0300_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_intro_1043_401pro", "source_sha256": "76269953e86f0f47784a122e00eba79c0c44af5d4e8df1bf84ecae0de2ace7cc", "ja": "はいっ！　そっか……いよいよ劇場で、\nアイドルたちと一緒に……。いよいよ……！", "zh": "好！这样啊……终于要在剧场里，和偶像们一起……终于要……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
